Verifying your details is an important step to make your studio **“Verified”** on Beat22. Follow the guide below to complete both **Mobile Number Verification** and **Aadhaar Verification via DigiLocker** easily.

### **Step 1: Mobile Number Verification**

1.  Go to **Settings → Account Settings** in your Beat22 dashboard.
2.  Enter your **mobile number** in the given field.
3.  Click on **Verify**.

![Click on Verify.](/images/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-05-173348.png)

4\. A **popup** will appear asking for the OTP sent to your number. 5. Enter the **OTP** and click on **Submit**. 6. Once verified, your mobile number will show as **Verified**.

### **Step 2: Aadhaar Verification (via DigiLocker)**

#### **If you’re 18 or above:**

1.  Under Account Settings, go to **Aadhaar Verification**.
2.  Click on **Verify via DigiLocker**.

![Click on Verify via DigiLocker.](/images/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-05-153506.png)

3\. A popup will appear — tick the checkbox for **“I have read and agree to the Terms & Conditions.”** 4. Click on **Continue with DigiLocker**.

![3\. A popup will appear — tick the checkbox for “I have read and agree to the Terms & Conditions.” 4. Click](/images/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-05-153907.png)

5\. You’ll be redirected to the DigiLocker page. 6. Click on **Start Verification** when prompted.

![5\. You’ll be redirected to the DigiLocker page. 6. Click on Start Verification when prompted.](/images/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-05-153931.png)

7\. On the next page, tick **“I consent to terms of use.”** 8. Click on **Sign In**.

![7\. On the next page, tick “I consent to terms of use.” 8. Click on Sign In.](/images/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-07-125358.png)

9\. You’ll receive an **OTP on your registered mobile number**, enter it and click **Sign In** again.

![9\. You’ll receive an OTP on your registered mobile number, enter it and click Sign In again.](/images/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-07-125443.png)

10\. A final DigiLocker popup will appear. Tick on **Aadhaar Card** and click **Allow**.

![10\. A final DigiLocker popup will appear. Tick on Aadhaar Card and click Allow.](/images/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-07-125719.png)

11\. You’ll see a message that says **“Redirecting back to requester.”**

![11\. You’ll see a message that says “Redirecting back to requester.”](/images/2025/11/Screenshot-2025-11-05-154141.png)

12\. Once redirected, the data will be fetched automatically. 13. **Refresh the page**, and you’ll see your Aadhaar status as **Verified.**

#### **If you’re below 18:**

You’ll need to complete **two verifications**, first with **your own Aadhaar**, and then again with your **guardian’s Aadhaar** following the same DigiLocker steps above. **Done!** Once both your **mobile number** and **Aadhaar** are verified, your studio will officially be marked as **Verified on Beat22**, unlocking better visibility, higher trust, and access to full platform features.
